entirety to all the parties.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.140
And the question would be,

00:10:20.141 --> 00:10:22.710
where can we emulate
this in a secure setting?

00:10:24.545 --> 00:10:26.541
So can we do circular
computation in just

00:10:26.542 --> 00:10:27.370
a single round?

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:31.930
But unfortunately, there
exists certain functions that

00:10:31.931 --> 00:10:34.070
