in a single round.

00:10:36.089 --> 00:10:37.906
So the best that we can hope for

00:10:37.907 --> 00:10:41.280
is to do secure
computation in two rounds.

00:10:41.281 --> 00:10:42.930
So the question is
what can we do secured

00:10:42.931 --> 00:10:44.149
